/E (Create a clean and minimal web page using React and Tailwind CSS that allows a user to upload an image of money. After the image is uploaded, show a preview of the image and a "Process" button. When the "Process" button is clicked, simulate an API call to an object detection model and display the detected denominations \(like "50,000", "20,000", etc.\) with bounding boxes over the image. Then, calculate and display the total amount of money detected below the image. Use placeholders for the API response and show mock predictions for testing \(e.g., "Detected: 50,000 IDR, 20,000 IDR, Total: 70,000 IDR"\). The layout should be responsive, center-aligned, and mobile-friendly. Use cards or sections to separate upload, preview, and result areas.)
